    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742620/extras/dbf33c07bf112cac5ea049a0ae79a62e.poster.avif?t=1743595855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742620/extras/dbf33c07bf112cac5ea049a0ae79a62e.webm?t=1743595855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Play and relax in your breaks, to fortify your brain or just to pass the time.<br><br>\u2713 Minimalist \u22c6 Procedural generation \u22c6 Fully randomic \u22c6 Inifinite levels<br><br>\u2713 No time \u22c6 No scores \u22c6 No helps \u22c6 No distractions<br><br>\u2713 Choose gameplay colors freely<br><br>\u2713 Very easy \u22c6 Easy \u22c6 Medium \u22c6 Hard \u22c6 Expert<br><br>\u2713 Due to procedural generation, levels may have more than one solution<br><br>Procedural generation, with levels that are completely random and infinite, a game that will never let you down, whenever you need this Sudoku will be waiting for you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742620/extras/2c6ed7a6becd280559464e3083fca3f7.poster.avif?t=1743595855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1742620/extras/2c6ed7a6becd280559464e3083fca3f7.webm?t=1743595855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
